        {
          "id": "69e04cad0a9473aaa9da4bbe",
          "questionNumber": 1,
          "type": "mcq",
          "text": "<p>What will come in the place of question mark (?) in the given expression?</p>\n\n<p>15<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;+ 31 &times; 2 + 9<sup>?</sup>&nbsp;= 18<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;&ndash; 10</p>",
          "image": null,
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "1",
              "label": "1",
              "text": "3",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "2",
              "label": "2",
              "text": "3/2",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "3",
              "label": "3",
              "text": "2",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "4",
              "label": "4",
              "text": "1/2",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "5",
              "label": "5",
              "text": "None of these",
              "image": null
            }
          ],
          "correctOptionId": "2",
          "marks": 1,
          "negativeMarks": 0.25,
          "explanation": "<p>15<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;+ 31 &times; 2 + 9<sup>?</sup>&nbsp;= 18<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;&ndash; 10</p>\n\n<p>225 + 62 + 9<sup>?</sup>&nbsp;= 324 &ndash; 10</p>\n\n<p>9<sup>?</sup>&nbsp;= 314 &ndash; 225 &ndash; 62</p>\n\n<p>9<sup>?</sup>&nbsp;= 27</p>\n\n<p>(3<sup>2</sup>)<sup>?</sup>&nbsp;= 3<sup>3</sup></p>\n\n<p>? = (3/2)</p>",
          "topic": "Test"
        },
        {
          "id": "69e04ccc58aca64a48d3cbb5",
          "questionNumber": 2,
          "type": "mcq",
          "text": "<p>What will come in the place of question mark (?) in the given expression?</p>\n\n<p>&radic;(100 of 36 of 4) = 200 &times; ?%</p>",
          "image": null,
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "1",
              "label": "1",
              "text": "60",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "2",
              "label": "2",
              "text": "40",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "3",
              "label": "3",
              "text": "120",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "4",
              "label": "4",
              "text": "80",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "5",
              "label": "5",
              "text": "50",
              "image": null
            }
          ],
          "correctOptionId": "1",
          "marks": 1,
          "negativeMarks": 0.25,
          "explanation": "<p>&radic;(100 of 36 of 4) = 200 &times; ?%</p>\n\n<p>= &radic;(100 &times; 36 &times; 4) = 200 &times; (?/100)</p>\n\n<p>= &radic;14400 = 2 &times; ?</p>\n\n<p>= 120 = 2 &times; ?</p>\n\n<p>? = 120 &divide; 2</p>\n\n<p>? = 60</p>",
          "topic": "Test"
        },
        {
          "id": "69e04c8b201bb7dade5e81bc",
          "questionNumber": 3,
          "type": "mcq",
          "text": "<p>What will come in the place of question mark (?) in the given expression?</p>\n\n<p>20% of 25 of ? = &radic;1600 &times; 2 + 10</p>",
          "image": null,
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "1",
              "label": "1",
              "text": "18",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "2",
              "label": "2",
              "text": "20",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "3",
              "label": "3",
              "text": "16",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "4",
              "label": "4",
              "text": "24",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "5",
              "label": "5",
              "text": "22",
              "image": null
            }
          ],
          "correctOptionId": "1",
          "marks": 1,
          "negativeMarks": 0.25,
          "explanation": "<p>20% of 25 of ? = &radic;1600 &times; 2 + 10</p>\n\n<p>= (20/100) &times; 25 &times; ? = 40 &times; 2 + 10</p>\n\n<p>= (1/5 &times; 25) &times; ? = 80 + 10</p>\n\n<p>= 5 &times; ? = 90</p>\n\n<p>? = 90 &divide; 5</p>\n\n<p>? = 18</p>",
          "topic": "Test"
        },
        {
          "id": "69cf5e4c2ab39e0734fee866",
          "questionNumber": 4,
          "type": "mcq",
          "text": "<p>What approximate value will come in place of question mark (?) in the following architectural planning calculation?<br />\n139.98 x 14.95 = ? - 210.02 x 8.04</p>",
          "image": null,
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "1",
              "label": "1",
              "text": "<p>3780</p>",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "2",
              "label": "2",
              "text": "<p>420</p>",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "3",
              "label": "3",
              "text": "<p>3800</p>",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "4",
              "label": "4",
              "text": "<p>3790</p>",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "5",
              "label": "5",
              "text": "<p>3680</p>",
              "image": null
            }
          ],
          "correctOptionId": "1",
          "marks": 1,
          "negativeMarks": 0.25,
          "explanation": "<span style=\"display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;\"><img height=\"26px\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/shortcut-trick-image.png\" width=\"26px\" /> <u style=\"font-size: 21px; font-weight: 700; display: inline !important;\">Shortcut Trick</u></span>\n<p>Approximate to nearest integers: 140 &times; 15 = ? &minus; 210 &times; 8</p>\n<p>Solve the products:<br />2100 = ? &minus; 1680</p>\n<p>Transpose values:<br />? = 2100 + 1680</p>\n<p>Calculate sum:<br />? = 3780</p>\n<p><strong>&there4; Answer = 3780</strong></p> <p><span style=\"display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;\"><img height=\"26px\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/alternate-methord-image.png\" /><strong><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;\"><u>Alternate Method</u></span></strong></span></p>\n<p><strong>Given:</strong></p>\n<p>Equation: 139.98 &times; 14.95 = ? &minus; 210.02 &times; 8.04</p>\n<p><strong>Formula used:</strong></p>\n<p>Rule of approximation: If the decimal part is &ge; 0.5, round up. If it is < 0.5, round down.</p>\n<svg width=\"420\" height=\"200\" viewBox=\"0 0 420 200\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"display:block;margin:12px 0;background:#ffffff;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #cccccc;\"> <defs> <marker id=\"arrow\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" refX=\"3\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"> <polygon points=\"0,0 6,3 0,6\" fill=\"#888888\" /> </marker> </defs> <rect x=\"50\" y=\"30\" width=\"140\" height=\"40\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ddeeff\" stroke=\"#2255cc\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" /> <text x=\"120\" y=\"55\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#222222\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">140 &times; 15</text> <text x=\"210\" y=\"55\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#222222\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">=</text> <rect x=\"230\" y=\"30\" width=\"160\" height=\"40\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#fff0cc\" stroke=\"#cc5500\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" /> <text x=\"310\" y=\"55\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#222222\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">? &minus; 210 &times; 8</text> <path d=\"M 120 70 L 120 100\" stroke=\"#888888\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\" /> <path d=\"M 310 70 L 310 100\" stroke=\"#888888\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\" /> <text x=\"120\" y=\"125\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#2255cc\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">2100</text> <text x=\"210\" y=\"125\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#222222\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">=</text> <text x=\"310\" y=\"125\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#cc5500\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">? &minus; 1680</text> <path d=\"M 210 135 L 210 155\" stroke=\"#888888\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\" /> <rect x=\"150\" y=\"160\" width=\"120\" height=\"30\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ccffcc\" stroke=\"#007700\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" /> <text x=\"210\" y=\"180\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#007700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">? = 3780</text>\n</svg>\n<p><strong>Calculations:</strong></p>\n<p>Approximating decimals to nearest integers:</p>\n<p>&rArr; 139.98 &asymp; 140</p>\n<p>&rArr; 14.95 &asymp; 15</p>\n<p>&rArr; 210.02 &asymp; 210</p>\n<p>&rArr; 8.04 &asymp; 8</p>\n<p>Substitute values into the given equation:</p>\n<p>&rArr; 140 &times; 15 = ? &minus; 210 &times; 8</p>\n<p>&rArr; 2100 = ? &minus; 1680</p>\n<p>&rArr; ? = 2100 + 1680</p>\n<p>&rArr; ? = 3780</p>\n<p><strong>&there4; The correct answer is<br />3780. (Option 1)</strong></p>",
          "topic": "Test"
        },
        {
          "id": "69646bc44a3b1e4e9cb43df1",
          "questionNumber": 5,
          "type": "mcq",
          "text": "<p>What will come in the place of question mark (?) in the given expression?</p>\n\n<p>30% of 600 &ndash; 25% of 240 = 15% of ?</p>",
          "image": null,
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "1",
              "label": "1",
              "text": "<p>480</p>",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "2",
              "label": "2",
              "text": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">500</p>",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "3",
              "label": "3",
              "text": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">520</p>",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "4",
              "label": "4",
              "text": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">540</p>",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "5",
              "label": "5",
              "text": "<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">None of these</span>",
              "image": null
            }
          ],
          "correctOptionId": "5",
          "marks": 1,
          "negativeMarks": 0.25,
          "explanation": "<p>30% of 600 &ndash; 25% of 240 = 15% of ?</p>\n\n<p>0.15 &times; ? = 0.30 &times; 600 &ndash; 0.25 &times; 240</p>\n\n<p>0.15 &times; ? = 180 &ndash; 60</p>\n\n<p>0.15 &times; ? = 120</p>\n\n<p>? = 120 &divide; 0.15</p>\n\n<p>? = 800</p>",
          "topic": "Test"
        },
