          "explanation": "<p><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Calculation</span></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"13\" data-start=\"0\">&rArr; 45.6% of 220&nbsp;+ 18.9 &divide; 3.02 &minus; 11.7</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"82\" data-start=\"54\">&rArr; 46% of 220&nbsp;+ 19 &divide; 3 &minus; 12</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"105\" data-start=\"84\">&rArr; 101.2 + 6.33 &minus; 12</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"121\" data-start=\"107\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr; 101&nbsp;+ 6&nbsp;&minus; 12</span></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"121\" data-start=\"107\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr; 101</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;- 6</span></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"121\" data-start=\"107\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr; 95</span></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"157\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"123\"><strong>&there4; Options 3) is the correct Answer<strong data-end=\"157\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-start=\"125\">.</strong></strong></p>",
