          "type": "mcq",
          "text": "<p>What value will come in the place of the question mark &lsquo;?&rsquo; in the following question?</p>\n\n<p>(33 &times; 17) - 75% of 640 = ? &ndash; 201</p>",
          "image": null,
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "1",
              "label": "1",
              "text": "255",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "2",
