          "type": "mcq",
          "text": "<p>What value will come in the place of the question mark &lsquo;?&rsquo; in the following question?</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;(24 - 16) <span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&times;&nbsp;</span>(2/6) &times; 180 &ndash; 125% of 800 = ?</p>",
